# Vercel Speed Insights Installation Report

## Summary
Successfully installed and configured Vercel Speed Insights for the CortexAI Plus ESP dashboard project.

## Changes Made

### 1. Package Installation
- **Added:** `@vercel/speed-insights@^2.0.0` to dependencies
- **Updated:** `package.json` with the new dependency
- **Updated:** `package-lock.json` with dependency tree

### 2. Code Implementation
- **Modified:** `app/layout.tsx`
  - Added import: `import { SpeedInsights } from '@vercel/speed-insights/next';`
  - Added component: `<SpeedInsights />` at the end of the `<body>` tag

## Implementation Details

### Framework Detection
- Project uses **Next.js 16.2.2** (App Router)
- Package manager: **npm** (detected via package-lock.json)

### Installation Approach
Following the official Vercel documentation (https://vercel.com/docs/speed-insights/quickstart):
- Used the Next.js-specific package: `@vercel/speed-insights/next`
- Placed the `<SpeedInsights />` component in the root layout file
- Component positioned at the end of the `<body>` tag, after all other content and providers

### Why This Implementation
1. **Root Layout Placement:** Ensures Speed Insights tracks all pages in the application
2. **End of Body:** Follows best practices to avoid blocking critical page rendering
3. **Next.js Import:** Uses the optimized Next.js-specific export for better integration

## Verification Steps Completed

✅ **Build Test:** `npm run build` completed successfully with no errors
✅ **Linting:** No new linting issues introduced in modified files
✅ **Type Safety:** TypeScript compilation passed without errors
✅ **Dependencies:** Lock file updated correctly

## Next Steps for User

To enable Speed Insights on Vercel:
1. Deploy the application to Vercel
2. Navigate to your project dashboard on Vercel
3. Go to the "Speed Insights" tab
4. Click the "Enable" button to activate Speed Insights
5. After deployment and user visits, metrics will be available in the dashboard

## Files Modified
- `app/layout.tsx` - Added SpeedInsights component
